"safety", "laboratory", "accident", "simulation", "contentsda"], "long_description": "1. Prepare for lab safety incidents: Put on safety equipment before your experiment. Wear safety glasses and a lab coat.\n2. How to operate an alkaline lamp: Find the alkaline lamp and igniter, place it on the white table, and flick the flame to experience fire.\n3. burn treatment: soak the burned area in water to reduce the heat and wrap it with clean gauze.\n4. Staunching wounds: Use clean gauze to staunch bleeding if a tool breaks during the experiment.\n5. organize experimental tools: put the alcohol lamp in the display case after the experiment is finished.\n6. fire response: If a fire occurs, use the fire extinguisher near the door to extinguish the fire.", "short_description": "Master the essential safety protocols for working in a laboratory. This training covers proper handling of chemicals, equipment use, and emergency procedures, ensuring a safe and informed lab environment."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://training.contentsda.kr/privacy-policy-en/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://training.contentsda.kr/terms-and-conditions-en/", "publisher_name": "ContentsDa Inc", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://training.contentsda.kr/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "ko"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "818033936